{"unit_id":"zzzyaar__dsh--API-message_stop-#card-zh","repo":"zzzyaar/dsh--API-message_stop-","commit":"d0ec38d0893b442c68317b044fedefbcb5bb57b5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-missing-stop-heal 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 插件，修复指定 provider 的流缺少 message_stop 或 done 后引发的重复重试。它监听 host 的 llm/stream，在已收到内容且满足终止条件时结束流。可用 providers 或 rules 配置范围，并按模型精确匹配或通配。网页设置页支持查看候选、增删启用规则、保存和恢复默认，修改对后续请求生效。适合使用第三方 Anthropic 兼容网关的 DSH 用户。需配置处理范围，不需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["heal.mjs:108-177","heal.mjs:272-289","client/client.js:143-197"]}
{"unit_id":"zzzyaar__dsh--API-message_stop-#card-en","repo":"zzzyaar/dsh--API-message_stop-","commit":"d0ec38d0893b442c68317b044fedefbcb5bb57b5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-missing-stop-heal stops repeated DeepSeek Harness retries when a selected provider omits message_stop or done. It wraps llm/stream and supports provider/model rules with wildcards. Users edit rules in the web settings page. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["heal.mjs:108-177","heal.mjs:272-289","client/client.js:143-197"]}
